[6.9e-05,"o","\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[1mWelcome to ~yzs's termblog\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nThis is both a personal blog and a real, temporary FreeBSD jail. Read, \r\nexplore, and leave a message as you would in a normal terminal. Files \r\ncreated during your session disappear when you exit.\r\n\r\nChinese guide: \u001b[36mblog help.md\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mQuick start\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m   blog                  # List articles\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m   blog help.md          # Read the Chinese guide\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m   blog help-en.md       # Read this English guide\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m   less ~/help-en.md     # View the Markdown source\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m   play                  # List terminal recordings\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m   play demo             # Play the site demo\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m   cat /proc/stat        # View the root scope's frozen statistics snapshot\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m   exit                  # End the session\r\n\r\nWhile reading, scroll with the arrow keys, Page Up, and Page Down; press \u001b[36mq\u001b[39m \r\nto return to the shell. During playback, Space pauses or resumes, \u001b[36m.\u001b[39m \r\nadvances one frame while paused, and \u001b[36mq\u001b[39m or Ctrl-C stops playback.\r\n"]
